# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  AUTH SERVICE — HTTP Tests
#
#  HOW TO USE (requires REST Client extension):
#  ────────────────────────────────────────────
#  1. Open this file in VS Code
#  2. You'll see "Send Request" appear above each ### block
#  3. Click it — response appears in a panel on the right
#
#  WHY THIS INSTEAD OF POSTMAN?
#  These files live IN your repo. Your tests are version-controlled,
#  shareable, and always up to date with your API.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Shared variables for this file
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authUrl = http://localhost:8081

# After running the login request, copy the token here:
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZW1haWwiOiJwbGF5ZXJAYXJlbmEuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6IlBMQVlFUiIsIm5hbWUiOiJUZXN0IFBsYXllciIsImlhdCI6MTc3NzczODAwNiwiZXhwIjoxNzc3ODI0NDA2fQ.6UFvNgir4DSXkNmkaeTBXFvEJe7JNxoMioczfANdTH9TDEEgfeIfldLK5WzYIDUl

###

# ── Test 1: Health check (no auth needed) ────────────────────
GET {{authUrl}}/actuator/health

### Debug login

# ── Test 2: Login with valid credentials ─────────────────────
# Expected: 200 OK with a JWT token in the response body
POST {{authUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "player@arena.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

# ── Test 3: Login with wrong password ────────────────────────
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

# ── Test 4: Login with missing field ─────────────────────────
# Expected: 400 Bad Request (validation error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-a-valid-email"
}

###

# ── Test 5: Validate a token ─────────────────────────────────
# Expected: 200 OK with user details
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# ── Test 6: Validate with no token ───────────────────────────
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized (Gateway blocks it)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate

###

### Generate hash
GET {{authUrl}}/auth/generate-hash